            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in ShawNotch 1.7.12</h2>
<ul>
<li>On macOS 14 Sonoma and 15 Sequoia, a new setting, <b>Use the album as your wallpaper</b>, makes the menu bar match the album in Music Mode. It's off until you turn it on in Settings, and your own wallpaper comes back when Music Mode turns off.</li>
</ul>
